=2 Walkthrough
You must have Rune Fencer set as your main job to get the starting cutscene from Octavien.
* Speak to {n:Octavien} to receive the key item {k:"Ephemeral Endeavor"}, then travel to {z:Rala Waterways} M-6 (Enter from Eastern Adoulin F-7).
* The fight is triggered by speaking to {n:Yeggha Dolashi} and clicking the door behind her which will send you to {z:Rala Waterways (U)}.
** Subjob is locked for this fight
** You can call {p:Trusts|Category:Trust} during this fight if you possess the {k:"Rhapsody in Umber"} key item.
* After ascending the stairs {n:Zurko-Bazurko} will spawn and attack. He has under 1100 HP.
* In the center of the arena, Sverdheid ??? waits and appears to be non-aggressive, giving you time to buff/heal.
** Dealing approximately 3700 points of damage will cause her to surrender; her maximum health is roughly 4000 HP.
*** Should you fail to complete the fight you must wait one game day to receive another {k:"Ephemeral Endeavor"} or give Octavien either 50,000 gil; 5,000 bayld; or 10 beastmen's seals.
* Clearing the fight will award you with {k:"Enlightened Endeavor"}.
* Return to {n:Octavien} to complete the quest.

=2 Notes
* Does not need to be completed (for level limit increasing) if the player has already completed {q:New Worlds Await|New Worlds Await|New Worlds Await} or better.
* Speaking to {n:Octavien} after starting {q:Forging New Bonds|Forging New Bonds|Forging New Bonds} will allow you to receive another {k:"Ephemeral Endeavor"} in exchange for 50,000 gil 5000 Bayld or 10 beastmen's seals. This will allow you to rechallenge Sverdheid ??? without Zurko-Bazurko.

